Hi all,

whenever a wand is empty, I #name it empty. I also #name worn out magic markers.
This makes it easy not to fiddle around with empty wands. Another trick is
to #name an identified wand by its max value to get the choice of which
wand to recharge first.

Last not least I #name refilled magic markers as refilled.

Just a hint...

	Gerry

